# desc: 한 판단 안에서 요소마다 다른 문헌이 대응한 것 — 요소별 문헌 분업은? (결손 element-to-document-link-missing)
# suite: pa
# monotone: up
# expect-min: 1
PREFIX pa:   <https://w3id.org/sdkb/pa/>
PREFIX pakr: <https://w3id.org/sdkb/pa/kr/>
SELECT ?j (COUNT(DISTINCT ?doc) AS ?docs) (COUNT(DISTINCT ?link) AS ?links)
WHERE { ?link a pa:EvidenceLink ; pa:partOfJudgment ?j ; pa:inDocument ?doc . }
GROUP BY ?j
HAVING (COUNT(DISTINCT ?doc) >= 2)
ORDER BY ?j
